# Generated Quran data IS committed: the app has no runtime text download, and static hosting
# (GitHub Pages, Docker) serves dist/data/ straight from these files:
#   quran-text.json  from `npm run data:import` (KFGQPC Hafs V30, offline, no network)
#   divisions.json   from `npm run data:fetch`    (Tanzil metadata via AlQuran.cloud, CC BY 3.0)
# After changing either script, regenerate and commit both. Licences: docs/DATA_SOURCES.md.
